      </condition>

      <then>
        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "1.15 OL09-00-000042"
          info        : "OL 9 must be configured to disable the FireWire kernel module.

GROUP ID: V-271445
RULE ID: SV-271445r1091047

Disabling firewire protects the system against exploitation of any flaws in its implementation."
          solution    : "Configure OL 9 to prevent the firewire-core kernel module from being loaded.

Add the following line to the file /etc/modprobe.d/firewire-core.conf (or create firewire-core.conf if it does not exist):

install firewire-core /bin/true
blacklist firewire-core"
