    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.282 OL09-00-002358"
      info        : "OL 9 must not allow users to override SSH environment variables.

GROUP ID: V-271720
RULE ID: SV-271720r1091872

SSH environment options potentially allow users to bypass access restriction in some configurations."
      solution    : "Configure the OL 9 SSH daemon to not allow unattended or automatic logon to the system.

