    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.289 OL09-00-002370"
      info        : "OL 9 must disable the use of user namespaces.

GROUP ID: V-271727
RULE ID: SV-271727r1091893

User namespaces are used primarily for Linux containers. The value \"0\" disallows the use of user namespaces."
      solution    : "Configure OL 9 to disable the use of user namespaces by adding the following line to a file, in the \"/etc/sysctl.d\" directory:

Note: User namespaces are used primarily for Linux containers. If containers are in use, this requirement is Not Applicable.

