    </custom_item>

    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CHECK
      description : "1.331 OL09-00-002502"
      info        : "OL 9 SSH private host key files must have mode 0640 or less permissive.

GROUP ID: V-271771
RULE ID: SV-271771r1092025

If an unauthorized user obtains the private SSH host key file, the host could be impersonated."
      solution    : "Configure the mode of SSH private host key files under \"/etc/ssh\" to \"0640\" with the following command:

$ sudo chmod 0640 /etc/ssh/ssh_host*key

Restart the SSH daemon for the changes to take effect:

$ sudo systemctl restart sshd.service"
