    <item>
      description : "1.393 OL09-00-003001"
      info        : "OL 9 duplicate User IDs (UIDs) must not exist for interactive users.

GROUP ID: V-271832
RULE ID: SV-271832r1092208

To ensure accountability and prevent unauthenticated access, interactive users must be identified and authenticated to prevent potential misuse and compromise of the system.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000104-GPOS-00051, SRG-OS-000121-GPOS-00062, SRG-OS-000042-GPOS-00020"
      solution    : "Edit the file \"/etc/passwd\" and provide each interactive user account that has a duplicate UID with a unique UID."
      reference   : "800-171|3.3.1,800-171|3.3.2,800-171|3.5.1,800-171r3|03.03.02b.,800-171r3|03.05.01a.,800-53|AU-3(1),800-53|IA-2,800-53|IA-8,800-53r5|AU-3(1),800-53r5|IA-2,800-53r5|IA-8,CCI|CCI-000135,CCI|CCI-000764,CCI|CCI-000804,CN-L3|7.1.3.1(a),CN-L3|7.1.3.1(e),CN-L3|7.1.3.3(b),CN-L3|8.1.4.1(a),CN-L3|8.1.4.2(a),CN-L3|8.5.4.1(a),CSF|PR.AC-1,CSF|PR.PT-1,CSF2.0|PR.AA-01,CSF2.0|PR.AA-03,CSF2.0|PR.PS-04,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(i),HIPAA|164.312(b),HIPAA|164.312(d),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.16,ISO-27001-2022|A.5.28,ISO-27001-2022|A.8.15,ITSG-33|AU-3(1),ITSG-33|IA-2,ITSG-33|IA-2a.,ITSG-33|IA-8,ITSG-33|IA-8a.,LEVEL|2A,NESA|T2.3.8,NESA|T3.6.2,NESA|T4.3.1,NESA|T5.3.1,NESA|T5.4.2,NESA|T5.5.1,NESA|T5.5.2,NESA|T5.5.3,NIAv2|AM2,NIAv2|AM8,NIAv2|AM14b,NIAv2|AM34a,NIAv2|AM34b,NIAv2|AM34c,NIAv2|AM34d,NIAv2|AM34e,NIAv2|AM34f,NIAv2|AM34g,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.1,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.2,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.3,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.4,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.5,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.6,PCI-DSSv4.0|10.2.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-271832r1092208_rule,STIG-ID|OL09-00-003001,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.8,SWIFT-CSCv1|6.4,TBA-FIISB|35.1,TBA-FIISB|36.1,Vuln-ID|V-271832"
